@startuml
title IAM Revocation Propagation Sequence
actor "SOC Analyst" as SOC
participant "IdP (Okta/AAD)" as IDP
participant "Revocation Event Bus" as BUS
participant "Policy Enforcement Point" as PEP
participant "Token Cache" as CACHE
participant "API Gateway" as API
participant "SIEM" as SIEM

SOC -> IDP: Disable user + rotate credentials
IDP -> BUS: Publish signed revocation event
BUS -> PEP: Push deny principal directive
BUS -> CACHE: Invalidate subject/session keys
PEP -> API: Enforce deny + quarantine route
API -> API: Terminate active sessions
BUS -> SIEM: Persist immutable timeline event
@enduml
